/Title (Grey\040Wolf\040Optimizer)
/Author (Seyedali\040Mirjalili\054\040Seyed\040Mohammad\040Mirjalili\054\040Andrew\040Lewis)
/Subject (This\040work\040proposes\040a\040new\040meta\055heuristic\040called\040Grey\040Wolf\040Optimizer\040\050GWO\051\040inspired\040by\040grey\040wolves\040\050Canis\040lupus\051\056\040The\040GWO\040algorithm\040mimics\040the\040leadership\040hierarchy\040and\040hunting\040mechanism\040of\040grey\040wolves\040in\040nature\056\040Four\040types\040of\040grey\040wolves\040such\040as\040alpha\054\040beta\054\040delta\054\040and\040omega\040are\040employed\040for\040simulating\040the\040leadership\040hierarchy\056\040In\040addition\054\040the\040three\040main\040steps\040of\040hunting\054\040searching\040for\040prey\054\040encircling\040prey\054\040and\040attacking\040prey\054\040are\040implemented\056\040The\040algorithm\040is\040then\040benchmarked\040on\04029\040well\055known\040test\040functions\054\040and\040the\040results\040are\040verified\040by\040a\040comparative\040study\040with\040Particle\040Swarm\040Optimization\040\050PSO\051\054\040Gravitational\040Search\040Algorithm\040\050GSA\051\054\040Differential\040Evolution\040\050DE\051\054\040Evolutionary\040Programming\040\050EP\051\054\040and\040Evolution\040Strategy\040\050ES\051\056\040The\040results\040show\040that\040the\040GWO\040algorithm\040is\040able\040to\040provide\040very\040competitive\040results\040compared\040to\040these\040well\055known\040meta\055heuristics\056\040The\040paper\040also\040considers\040solving\040three\040classical\040engineering\040design\040problems\040\050tension\057compression\040spring\054\040welded\040beam\054\040and\040pressure\040vessel\040designs\051\040and\040presents\040a\040real\040application\040of\040the\040proposed\040method\040in\040the\040field\040of\040optical\040engineering\056\040The\040results\040of\040the\040classical\040engineering\040design\040problems\040and\040real\040application\040prove\040that\040the\040proposed\040algorithm\040is\040applicable\040to\040challenging\040problems\040with\040unknown\040search\040spaces\056)
